#42900
Hugo~
   So, you're interested in assisting me in my task.  Many moons ago I created
a drink for King Xerxes himself, and as a reward he had a flask crafted just
for me.  Ever since then, I've been unable to recreate the drink, due to a lack
of supplies.  If you could gather the ingredients for me I could reconnect with
my roots and attempt to remake the drink.  I really think that would be just
the thing I need to get back in the groove of things.  If you're interested,
the ingredients needed for brewing are some special fungus, barley, a cask,
some malt, and some yeast.    
~
Gather some special fungus, barley, a cask, some malt, and some yeast for Hugo.
~
